  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bespoke English Language Training Supporting Lao PDR to chair ASEAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this activity is to increase the English language capacity of Lao Officials to better chair ASEAN in 2024. 
